OL,3,GNEWSARail services cancelled due to
OL,4,Asignalling fault
OL,5,
OL,6,FRail passengers are being warned of
OL,7,Fmajor disruption after a signalling
OL,8,Ffault forced the closure of lines in
OL,9,Fand out of Birmingham Moor Street.
OL,11,FThe fault has closed all lines between
OL,12,Fthe station and Small Heath, with
OL,13,Fservices also unable to operate between
OL,14,FMoor Street and Leamington Spa and
OL,15,FStratford-upon-Avon.
OL,17,FAs a result, trains, including services
OL,18,Fto London Marylebone, are either being
OL,19,Fcancelled entirely or running on
OL,20,Fshortened routes.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
