OL,3,GNEWSARail services cancelled due to
OL,4,Asignalling fault
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe disruption is affecting both
OL,7,FChiltern Railways and West Midlands
OL,8,FRailway services and is expected to
OL,9,Fcontinue until at least 12.00 GMT.
OL,10,FNational Rail is advising passengers to
OL,11,Fcheck their journeys before setting
OL,12,Foff.
